    "limitations": "The common 45-byte area is LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL for both fixed and variable funds; fixed funds append 34 bytes from LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL. Join by policy, company, system, coverage phase and fund ID. Non-tiered fixed records end at byte 79. Variable funds omit the fixed area; live rendering is guarded until a capture verifies that variant. Tiered amount (1T) and duration (1D) methods append the documented count and rate/limit area, but are guarded until real rows establish count, length and ordering. NULL slots are dim and annotated, distinct from stored zero or blanks. Flag A is live; reserved B/U bits are illustrative amber zeros.",
    "archive_corrections": "6255 (not 6275); 8 Flag A bits; High Phase 60-61; key 62-72; initial rate 73-75; end date 76-79; tier count 80-81."
  },
  "layout_html": "<p>The common 45-byte area is LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL for both fixed and variable funds; fixed funds append 34 bytes from LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL. Join by policy, company, system, coverage phase and fund ID. Non-tiered fixed records end at byte 79. Variable funds omit the fixed area; live rendering is guarded until a capture verifies that variant. Tiered amount (1T) and duration (1D) methods append the documented count and rate/limit area, but are guarded until real rows establish count, length and ordering. NULL slots are dim and annotated, distinct from stored zero or blanks. Flag A is live; reserved B/U bits are illustrative amber zeros.</p><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\"><tr bgcolor=\"#E6A0AA\"><th>Byte</th><th>Field / source / applicability</th></tr><tr><td>1-2</td><td><b>Segment Identification</b><br>Byte: 1-2<br>COBOL: FIFIDENT-SEGMENT-ID</td></tr><tr><td>3-4</td><td><b>Segment Length</b><br>Byte: 3-4<br>COBOL: FIFLNGTH-SEGMENT-LENGTH<br>Verified fixed non-tiered length 79 = 45-byte common area + 34-byte fixed area.</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><b>Flag Byte A</b><br>Byte: 5<br>COBOL: FIFFLAGA-FLAG-BYTE-A<br>Bit 0: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.ICP_ACY_IND<br>Bit 1: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.ACTING_VAL_SEG_IND<br>Bit 2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.IRL_GNR_IND<br>Bit 3: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.DEL_IND<br>Bit 4: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.RE_ADDED_IND<br>Bit 5: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.IDX_ANU_IND<br>Bit 6: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.MVA_APP_IND<br>Bit 7: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.FND_VAL_STA_IND</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><b>Flag Byte B</b><br>Byte: 6<br>COBOL: FIFFLAGB-FLAG-BYTE-B<br>Reserved; no DB2 mapping. Captured zeros are amber examples.</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td><b>Flag Byte U</b><br>Byte: 7<br>COBOL: FIFFLAGU-USER-FLAG-BYTE<br>Reserved; no DB2 mapping. Captured zeros are amber examples.</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td><b>Coverage Phase</b><br>Byte: 8<br>COBOL: FIFCOVPH-ASSOC-COV-PHASE<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.COV_PHA_NBR<br>Common area<br>Format: 1-byte unsigned binary; display as a decimal integer.</td></tr><tr><td>9-10</td><td><b>Fund Identification</b><br>Byte: 9-10<br>COBOL: FIFFNDID-FUND-ID<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.FND_ID_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 2 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td><b>Fund Type</b><br>Byte: 11<br>COBOL: FIFFNDTY-FUND-TYPE<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.FND_TYP_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td><b>Qualified/Nonqualified</b><br>Byte: 12<br>COBOL: FIFFNDQL-FUND-QUALIFICATION<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.FND_TAX_STA_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>13-14</td><td><b>Minimum Balance Table</b><br>Byte: 13-14<br>COBOL: FIFMBTBL-MIN-BAL-TBL-CODE<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.FND_MIN_BAL_TBL_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 2 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td><b>Initial Minimum Balance Rule</b><br>Byte: 15<br>COBOL: FIFMBINL-INITIAL<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.INT_MIN_BAL_RLE_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td><b>Remain Minimum Balance Rule</b><br>Byte: 16<br>COBOL: FIFMBRMN-REMAIN<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.RMD_MIN_BAL_RLE_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td><b>Purchase Rule</b><br>Byte: 17<br>COBOL: FIFPURCH-PURCHASE-RULE<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.FND_PUR_RLE_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td><b>Transfers</b><br>Byte: 18<br>COBOL: FIFDTRNF-TRANSFERS<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.TRF_RLE_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>19</td><td><b>Withdrawals</b><br>Byte: 19<br>COBOL: FIFDWDRW-WITHDRAWALS<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.WTD_RLE_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td><b>Loans</b><br>Byte: 20<br>COBOL: FIFDLOAN-LOANS<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.LN_RLE_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>21</td><td><b>Loan Interest</b><br>Byte: 21<br>COBOL: FIFDLINT-LOAN-INTEREST<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.LN_ITS_RLE_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>22</td><td><b>Charges</b><br>Byte: 22<br>COBOL: FIFDCHRG-CHARGES<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.CRG_RLE_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>23-24</td><td><b>Minimum Duration</b><br>Byte: 23-24<br>COBOL: FIFDMDUR-MIN-DUR-PRIOR<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.MIN_DUR<br>Common area<br>Format: 3 packed digits, no decimals.</td></tr><tr><td>25-26</td><td><b>Penalties Table</b><br>Byte: 25-26<br>COBOL: FIFPTBLE-PENALTY-TABLE<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.PNY_TBL_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 2 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>27</td><td><b>Penalties Rule 1</b><br>Byte: 27<br>COBOL: FIFPRUL1-PENALTY-RULE-1<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.PNY_RLE_1_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>28</td><td><b>Penalties Rule 2</b><br>Byte: 28<br>COBOL: FIFPRUL2-PENALTY-RULE-2<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.PNY_RLE_2_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>29-32</td><td><b>Last Transfer Date</b><br>Byte: 29-32<br>COBOL: FIFLTRDT-LAST-TRANSFER-DATE<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.LST_TRF_DT<br>Common area<br>Format: 4-byte internal date; MM/DD/YYYY. High-date sentinel displays **/**/****.</td></tr><tr><td>33</td><td><b>Last Transfer In/Out</b><br>Byte: 33<br>COBOL: FIFLTRTY-LAST-TRNSFR-TYPE<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.LST_TRF_TYP_CD<br>Common area<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>34-36</td><td><b>Assumed Interest Rate</b><br>Byte: 34-36<br>COBOL: FIFVAIRT-ASSUM-INT-RATE<br>DB2: LH_COV_IVM_FND_CTL.ANU_ASM_ITS_RT<br>Common area<br>Format: 3-byte packed, 2 whole digits and 3 decimals; e.g. 4.000, not .040.</td></tr><tr><td>37-45</td><td><b>Reserved</b><br>Byte: 37-45<br>COBOL: FIFRESV-RESERVED</td></tr><tr><td>46</td><td><b>Investment Method</b><br>Byte: 46<br>COBOL: FIFFIVMT-INVESTMENT-METHOD<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.IVM_MTH_TYP_CD<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>47</td><td><b>Investment Method Subtype</b><br>Byte: 47<br>COBOL: FIFFISTP-INV-SUBTYPE<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.IVM_MTH_SBY_CD<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>48-49</td><td><b>Interest Accrual Frequency</b><br>Byte: 48-49<br>COBOL: FIFFIFRQ-INTEREST-FREQUENCY<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.ITS_ACCR_FQY_PER<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 3 packed digits, no decimals.</td></tr><tr><td>50</td><td><b>Compound Rule</b><br>Byte: 50<br>COBOL: FIFFCMPD-INT-COMPOUND-RULE<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.ITS_CMPD_RLE_CD<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>51-53</td><td><b>Guaranteed Interest Rate</b><br>Byte: 51-53<br>COBOL: FIFFGIRT-GUAR-INT-RATE<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.GUA_FND_ITS_RT<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 3-byte packed, 2 whole digits and 3 decimals; e.g. 4.000, not .040.</td></tr><tr><td>54</td><td><b>Guaranteed Rule</b><br>Byte: 54<br>COBOL: FIFFGRUL-INT-GUAR-RULE<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.GUA_ITS_PER_RLE_CD<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>55-56</td><td><b>Guaranteed Interest Period</b><br>Byte: 55-56<br>COBOL: FIFFGPRD-INIT-GUAR-PERIOD<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.GUA_ITS_PER<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 3 packed digits, no decimals.</td></tr><tr><td>57</td><td><b>User Rule for guaranteed calculation</b><br>Byte: 57<br>COBOL: FIFFGURL-USER-GUAR-RULE<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.ADD_GUA_PER_RLE_CD<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 1 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>58-59</td><td><b>User months for guaranteed period</b><br>Byte: 58-59<br>COBOL: FIFFGUPD-USER-GUAR-PERIOD<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.ADD_GUA_PER<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 3 packed digits, no decimals.</td></tr><tr><td>60-61</td><td><b>High Phase</b><br>Byte: 60-61<br>COBOL: FIFHIPHS-FUND-HIGH-PHASE-CODE<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.HI_FND_VAL_PHA_NBR<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 2-byte unsigned binary; display as a decimal integer.<br>Two bytes (D202 pp.75/600), not the stale one-byte HTML layout.</td></tr><tr><td>62-72</td><td><b>Current Interest Rates File Search Key</b><br>Byte: 62-72<br>COBOL: FIFFKEY-INT-RTE-FILE-SRCH-KY<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.CUR_ITS_RT_SER_NBR<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 11 character(s); stored blanks remain blank.</td></tr><tr><td>73-75</td><td><b>Initial Interest Rate</b><br>Byte: 73-75<br>COBOL: FIFIDIR-ISS-DATA-INT-RATE<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.CUR_ITS_RT<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 3-byte packed, 2 whole digits and 3 decimals; e.g. 4.000, not .040.</td></tr><tr><td>76-79</td><td><b>Initial Interest Rate End Date</b><br>Byte: 76-79<br>COBOL: FIFISEDT-ISS-DATA-END-DATE<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.ITS_PER_END_DT<br>Fixed funds only<br>Format: 4-byte internal date; MM/DD/YYYY. High-date sentinel displays **/**/****.</td></tr><tr><td>80-81</td><td><b>Number of Interest Rate/Limit Pairs</b><br>Byte: 80-81<br>COBOL: FIFTNENT-NUMBER-OF-TIERS<br>DB2: LH_COV_FXD_FND_CTL.TIER_ITS_RT_NBR<br>Tiered/duration portfolio only; rendering guarded pending live verification<br>D202 documents up to eight 8-byte rate/limit pairs, ascending by limit. SEG_IDX_NBR and live stored length/count semantics require verification.</td></tr><tr><td>82-84 (+8 per entry, up to 8)</td><td><b>Tier Interest Rate</b><br>Byte: 82-84 (+8 per entry, up to 8)<br>COBOL: FIFTRATE-TIER-RATE<br>DB2: LH_AMT_TIERED_ITS.TIER_ITS_RT / LH_DUR_TIERED_ITS.TIER_ITS_RT<br>Method 1T / 1D respectively; rendering guarded</td></tr><tr><td>85-89 (+8 per entry, up to 8)</td><td><b>Tier Interest Rate Limit</b><br>Byte: 85-89 (+8 per entry, up to 8)<br>COBOL: FIFTLIMT-TIER-LIMIT<br>DB2: LH_AMT_TIERED_ITS.ITS_TIER_AMT / LH_DUR_TIERED_ITS.ITS_TIER_DUR<br>Amount / duration redefine; rendering guarded</td></tr></table>"
}
